{
  "version": "1.2.0",
  "_note": "Map Travel phase 1 (docs/TRAVEL.md): server-priced bus and taxi rides between CT Island venues, plus the free walk. The client never sends a price, origin or distance: the server measures from the player's last accepted island position (ctl:pos) to the destination door in contract/ids/districts.json. Fares are integer Cash cents and flat per mode (wealth unlocks modes via unlockNetWorthCents, it never raises prices). Every value here is a tunable default pending product sign-off. busStops are generated by the frontend repo's tools/world/islandgen/export_bus_stops.py from the island plan (island metres, yaw in degrees clockwise from north, open side towards the road; shelter 'baked' = built by islandgen, 'kit' = placed by the client). Phase 3 (capability travelHeli): heli is a flat-fare flight from a helipad. Only players with a live home of a heliHomeKinds kind may fly; they board at their own home pad (homePads) or any public pad (heliPads) within heliPadRadiusM, and land on the public pad nearest the destination door. heliPads are the island plan's three helipads plus two downtown pads (Genesis Park's lawn and the boardwalk south of CT Jail, 1.2.0) so flights to downtown venues land within 150 m of the door; homePads are the pads the client builds beside those homes.",
